#. i18n: C:/Users/mf/Documents/XTrackCAD/src/v5_3_0_beta1/app/lib/demos/dmelev.xtr:344
#: ../../../../build/v_5_3_0_beta1/app/i18n/custmsg.h:475
msgid ""
"The last thing we want to do is to create a Station label that we'll use in "
