#: ../../../../build/v_5_3_0_beta1/app/i18n/custmsg.h:655
msgid ""
"Note: we could set the elevations anywhere along the connecting tracks "
"instead.  XTrackCAD treats a helix as a single length of track for "
"elevations.\n"
