#. i18n: C:/Users/mf/Documents/XTrackCAD/src/v5_3_0_beta1/app/lib/demos/dmtbledg.xtr:23
#: ../../../../build/v_5_3_0_beta1/app/i18n/custmsg.h:1073
msgid ""
"Table Edges are used to mark the edges of the layout, either for aisles or "
